    "chunk_text": ". Betonica se leasse bisceopvyrt. Betunus heope. Beta benedicta. Berbenaces eascvyrt. Berbescum gescadvyrt. Brogus head. Borotium uel boratium eoforthrote. Botration clufthunge uel thung. Bobonaca hrate. Bronia hymelyc. Bricium cerse. Brittannica vihtmeresvyrt uel heaven hnidele. Buglosse foxesgloue. Bucstalmum hvit megethe. Buglossan glofvyrt uel hundestunga. Bulbus belene. Bulbi scillici gledere. Calamus hreod. Calesta uel calcesta hvit cleaure. Calta siluatica vudecleaure. Calciculium geacessure. Calistricus uel calitircem ealifer uel vetervyrt. Camicula argella. Cameleon uel camedris vuluescomb. Camemileon alba uel camemelon se brade vuluesteals. Camesete ellenvyrt. Camelon eorthcrop. Chamedafne leothvyrt uel hrafnesfot. Camepitum eacrop. Camerion metethistel. Camemelon magethe. Campepithis henep. Canna hreod. Canis lingua hundestunga. Canduelis lindetvigle. Canis caput hundesheauod. Caprifolium vudebinde. Cape henep. Capparis vudebend. Cardus thistel. Carix secg. Cariscus ficbeam. Cariota valchmora. Cariscus cvicbeam. Carocasia hareminte. Carduus siluaticus vudethistel. Castanea cistelbeam. Catharticum lybbcorn. Caula caul. Celidonia celithenie. Centauria eorthgella uel hyrdvyrt uel curmelle. Cenocephaleon heortcleaure. Centenodia unfortredenvyrt. Cepa henne",
